### U-Mint Blockchain Integration API Test Requests
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@userId = 68333d5c220a921886614f31
@nftId = 6833efgh220a921886614f33
@collectionId = 6833abcd220a921886614f32
@saleId = 6833ijkl220a921886614f34
@walletAddress = 0x1234567890123456789012345678901234567890

### ==================== BLOCKCHAIN INFO ====================

### Get contract addresses
GET {{baseUrl}}/blockchain/addresses

### ==================== NFT MINTING ====================

### Mint a new NFT on the blockchain
POST {{baseUrl}}/blockchain/mint
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "address": "{{walletAddress}}"
}

### Get token information
GET {{baseUrl}}/blockchain/token/1

### Set base URI for NFT collection
POST {{baseUrl}}/blockchain/set-base-uri
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "baseUri": "https://api.u-mint.com/api/collections/{{collectionId}}/metadata/"
}

### ==================== MARKETPLACE OPERATIONS ====================

### List NFT for sale on the blockchain
POST {{baseUrl}}/blockchain/list
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nftAddress": "0x0987654321098765432109876543210987654321",
  "tokenId": "1",
  "price": "0.1"
}

### Buy NFT from the marketplace
POST {{baseUrl}}/blockchain/buy
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nftAddress": "0x0987654321098765432109876543210987654321",
  "tokenId": "1",
  "price": "0.1"
}

### Cancel NFT listing
POST {{baseUrl}}/blockchain/cancel
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nftAddress": "0x0987654321098765432109876543210987654321",
  "tokenId": "1"
}

### Get NFT listing information
GET {{baseUrl}}/blockchain/listing?nftAddress=0x0987654321098765432109876543210987654321&tokenId=1

### ==================== BLOCKCHAIN INTEGRATION ====================

### Mint NFT on blockchain and update database
POST {{baseUrl}}/nfts/blockchain/mint/{{nftId}}

### Create collection on blockchain
POST {{baseUrl}}/collections/blockchain/create/{{collectionId}}

### List NFT for sale on blockchain
POST {{baseUrl}}/sales/blockchain/list/{{saleId}}

### Buy NFT on blockchain
POST {{baseUrl}}/sales/blockchain/buy/{{saleId}}/{{userId}}

### Cancel NFT sale on blockchain
POST {{baseUrl}}/sales/blockchain/cancel/{{saleId}}

### Sync NFT with blockchain data
POST {{baseUrl}}/nfts/blockchain/sync/{{nftId}} 